<title>USA: Productivity Tech Q1 net income declines.</title>
<headline>Productivity Tech Q1 net income declines.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			   $n/a		     $n/a</p>
<p> Net			 14,333		  125,502</p>
